x = 150`** — the raster that gets **embedded**; **`dpi_answer = 220`** — the raster `read` sees, pinned and part of `read_key`. Both ported verbatim from `impl/config.yaml` | F19, §7.2.6; `fetch` defaults to 150 and escalates on request (§7.3) |\n| Embedding parameters | `dim` ∈ {768, 1536, 3072} via `output_dimensionality` (MRL truncation, dim recorded in the collection name); `concurrency=8`; `batch_size=8`; `max_edge_px=1568` | all four from `impl/config.yaml`; changing `dim` is","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/Users/sabesonk/.claude/projects/-Users-sabesonk-Documents-DILMAH-dilmah-engineering-solutioning-poc-vision-segmentation-index-and-retrieval/4eefb16f-3989-4441-9cd3-d294cfccb11f/tool-results/byoppcis6.txt","persistedOutputSize":39046}}
