stor \"segment.py's Gemini calls\" (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/vlm/prompts/` (`s1.md`, `s2.md`, `read.md`) — no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/app.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `main.py` (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/envelope.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `api_models.py` (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/auth.py`, `audit.py`, `budget.py` — + net new (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/tools/skim.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `retrieve.py::search` + rrf + decompose (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/tools/lookup.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `retrieve.py::lookup` (rewritten as a phrase filter) (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/tools/resolve.py` — ← port, impl ancestor `retrieve.py::resolve` (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/tools/read.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `retrieve.py::read` (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/serve/tools/fetch.py`, `verify.py` — + net new (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/mcp/server.py` — + net new (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/runner/loop.py`, `prompt.py`, `triage.py`, `answer.py` — + net new (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/vsir/cli.py` — ≈ port-with-changes, impl ancestor `scripts/interfaces_demo.py` (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `backend/tests/unit/` (L0–L1), `api/` (L2–L3), `paid/` (L4) — no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `frontend/` — React + TypeScript + Vite, M7 only; no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `e2e/` — Playwright, \"exists\"; no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `data/source/` — input PDFs, gitignored except generated fixtures; no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `data/fixtures/` — frozen extractions, checked in; no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Layout] `scripts/test-unit.sh`, `test-api.sh`, `test-e2e.sh`, `test-paid.sh` — \"exists, extend\"; no marker given (Spec §4.1)\n- [Pin] Python 3.11, exact minor pinned by the image digest — Factor II (Spec §4