.22.0, qdrant-client==1.19.0, PyMuPDF==1.28.2, pillow==12.3.0; qdrant/qdrant:v1.19.0; ports backend dev 8000 / test 8001, Qdrant dev 6333 REST + 6334 gRPC so test takes 6335 (never 6334), frontend dev 5173 / test 5174; dpi_index=150 (embedded) / dpi_answer=220 (read, pinned, part of read_key); dim ∈ {768,1536,3072}, concurrency=8, batch_size=8, max_edge_px=1568; rrf_k=60, weights page 1.0/lexical 1.0/captions 0.4, cap_pages_per_window=30, lookup_cap=20. Store is **Qdrant only**, two collections `vsir_pages` + `vsir_runs`. No relational DB, ORM, migration tool or queue service.\n- §4.4 CLI: doctor (M0), demo exact --synthetic (M1), ingest [--vlm stub|--resume|--steal] (M2a), runs show (M2a), gates rerun (M2a), publish --override --reason (M2b), serve (M3), mcp [--stdio|--sse] (M3), lookup/verify/resolve/skim/fetch/read one-shots (M3–M5), demo narrow (M4), ask (M6), eval acceptance|abstention|corpus (M3, M8), retire <doc_id> [--revision] (M8).\n- §17 open questions: OQ-1 pilot PDF location (blocks ONLY the M2b re-bill — the S2 responses are already in impl/data/raw/); OQ-2 Gemini key (blocks M2b/M5/M6 paid paths only — replay mode covers the rest); OQ-3/OQ-7 Part A export sign-off (M8); OQ-4 resolved by design; OQ-5 one collection.\n\n## Output format — repeat this block for EVERY unit, in milestone order\n### Synthesis Agent 2: Unit Decomposition\n\nUnit ID: U001 (sequential, zero-padded, never reused)\nName: <short descriptive name>\nMilestone: <M0|M1|M2a|M2b|M3|M4|M5|M6|M7|M8>\nType: <core|ingest|tool|mcp|runner|frontend|harness|eval>\nPriority: <P0-Critical|P1-High|P2-Medium|P3-Low>\nSize Estimate: <Small|Medium|Large>\nSpend: <none|paid>\nDepends On: [<unit IDs>]\nEnables: [<unit IDs>]\nSpec References: [Spec §X.Y, …]\nInvariants Enforced: [I<n>… — only ones this milestone owns, or empty]\nFailure Rows Closed: [F<n>… — only ones this milestone owns; say \"(fetch half)\" etc. for split rows, or empty]\nRequired Reading: [`impl/app/<module>.py` for every ← or ≈ mod