e: M6\nType: runner\nPriority: P0-Critical\nSize Estimate: Large\nSpend: paid\nDepends On: [U021, U020]\nEnables: [U023, U025]\nSpec References: [Spec §8.3, §8.4, §8.5, §7.4]\nInvariants Enforced: [I8]\nFailure Rows Closed: []\nRequired Reading: [`IMPROVEMENTS.md` — reconfirm no allowlist/keyword-taxonomy pattern leaks into the answer gate or abstention wording]\n\nDescription:\n- Complete the agentic loop with the six correction loops and the server-side answer gate, and expose it as `POST /ask` / `vsir ask` — the first unit where a full question-to-answer cycle runs for real.\n\nCore Requirements:\n- `runner/loop.py` (net new): the full loop (§8.1) driving U021's triage/routing through real `fetch`/`read`/`verify` calls; the six correction loops (§8.3), including Loop 1's automatic transcription correction (already inside `read` per U019) and the other five orchestrated here.\n- `runner/answer.py` (net new): server-side answer gate (I8) — every asserted code verified against the page it is cited on, per `(claim, page)` via `core/verify.py`; three branches (verified answer / read-from-image answer / abstain); constrained abstention wording (§8.5) — forbidden while `pages_no_text_read < scope_stats.pages_no_text`.\n- `VSIR_READS_PER_QUESTION` default 3 enforced.\n- `POST /ask` route + `vsir ask` CLI (§4.4).\n\nWorking Deliverable:\n- `POST /ask` + `vsir ask`.\n\nDemo Command:\n- `VSIR_ALLOW_PAID=1 vsir ask \"the carton discharge won't restart after an E-stop reset\"` — the milestone's official demo: prints the agent's move-by-move trace, then a gated answer with verified/read-from-image/unverifiable badges per cited code (I8).\n\nDeliverables (files):\n- `backend/vsir/runner/loop.py`, `runner/answer.py` (written, net new)\n- `backend/vsir/serve/app.py` (extended — `POST /ask` route)\n- `backend/vsir/cli.py` (extended — `ask` subcommand)\n- `backend/tests/paid/test_ask_real.py` (written, gated by `scripts/test-paid.sh`)\n\nTwelve-Factor Notes:\n- Adds `.env.example` 