{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CetE6muz5dKU9JdvSd7z9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HS3KxCzkDNYobUM2ef9FX1","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Test strategy per unit","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","run_in_background":false,"prompt":"You are Synthesis Agent S3 (test strategy) for a PLAN-ONLY planning task. DO NOT WRITE FILES. DO NOT IMPLEMENT CODE. Output your test strategy as your final message only.\n\nSpec: `development/cr1/spec/spec.md` in /Users/sabesonk/Documents/DILMAH/dilmah-engineering-solutioning/poc/vision_segmentation_index_and_retrieval. You may read at most 3 targeted ranges with `sed -n` (suggested: §12 at lines 1230–1360, §7.3 at 982–995, §11.1/§11.3 at 1194–1223). Do NOT read the whole spec.\n\n## The 26 units (authoritative — use these IDs exactly)\nM0 (none): U001 Runtime skeleton+pins+Dockerfile+.env.example+JSON logs+SIGTERM+release_id+`vsir doctor` [F11 boot] · U002 docker-compose.test.yml→Qdrant, GET /health + GET /ready, scripts/test-{unit,api,e2e,paid}.sh, conformance-grep test, AGENTS.md\nM1 (none): U003 core/record.py + core/ids.py + core/indexed.py + Qdrant collection & text-index creation [I6] · U004 core/tok.py + variants.py + exact.py + core/status.py (six-value enum) + serve/envelope.py (Family A and B) + §7.3 cap validators + ports ingest/sparse.py and rrf() [I3,I5;F10] · U005 four hand-written synthetic pages, serve/tools/lookup.py as a pure function, observed-token inventory, `vsir demo exact --synthetic` [I2;F1,F3,F14] · U006 core/verify.py::verify_claims + present_instead + near-miss generator + the L3 abstention eval [F2 core, F16]\nM2a (none): U007 ingest/manifest.py+probe.py+render.py+window.py (bisection) + the generated data/source/synthetic_3window.pdf with an off-by-one trap and a crop trap [F13,F15] · U008 vlm/{client,cache,stub}.py + prompts/{s1,s2}.md + ingest/extract.py + replay mode with typed `fixture_miss` [F11 key] · U009 ingest/derive.py (grounded_rate, no gate) + core/health.py + label precedence + code reattribution + ingest/stitch.py [F5 M2a, F6, F8 stitching] · U010 ingest/embed.py (D4 interleaved) + captions/lexical sparse surfaces + §6.6 fingerprint + ingest/index.py (is_current=False) · U011 ingest/gates.py + publish + three-clause retirement + vsir_runs control collection + lease + ingest/export.py + run record + `vsir runs show`/`gates rerun`/`publish --override` [I1,I4,I7;F4 M2a,F7,F12 M2a,F17]\nM2b (milestone spend paid): U012 port impl/data/raw/* and impl/data/exports/r-poc-*/{labels,withheld}.jsonl into data/fixtures/legacy/ + the L2 parity and negative-set suite — SPEND NONE · U013 the one real paid TC1E-SF ingest, freeze data/fixtures/TC1E-SF/*, set the grounded_rate threshold from the distribution (R4) — SPEND PAID\nM3 (none): U014 serve/app.py + serve/auth.py + serve/audit.py + serve/budget.py + `vsir serve` + §11.3 degradation · U015 serve/tools/lookup.py and verify.py HTTP wrappers + the six-value status surfaced + next.suggest + mcp/server.py stdio+SSE + `vsir lookup`/`vsir verify`/`vsir mcp` [F2 tool, F4 M3] · U016 `vsir eval acceptance` + `vsir eval abstention`\nM4 (none): U017 serve/tools/skim.py `skim_pages` + RRF ordering + decompose + exclude + next affordances + image queries (D12) + serve/tools/resolve.py [F5 M4, F8 stateless] · U018 GET /pages/{page_id}/image + the in-process raster LRU cache + serve/tools/fetch.py + §7.3 caps + `vsir demo narrow` [F18 fetch]\nM5 (milestone spend paid): U019 `skim_documents` + `skim_sections` aggregation + `searchable_ratio` on every DocHit — SPEND NONE · U020 serve/tools/read.py: per-code present/absent/unverifiable stamps, `sufficient`, `page_provenance`, ≤3-page cap, question-keyed `read_key` cache, vlm/prompts/read.md [F18 read, F19] — SPEND PAID\nM6 (milestone spend paid): U021 runner/triage.py (tri-state relevant|uncertain|irrelevant) + runner/prompt.py + §8.1a fetch-vs-read routing + `vsir ask --e