pserted by `ingest/index.py` for a newly-ingested document has payload `is_current == False`\n- [ ] `fingerprint(embedding_model, schema_version)` is identical across two calls with identical inputs and differs when `embedding_model` changes\n- [ ] upserting into a collection whose stored fingerprint differs from the current fingerprint raises a refusal, never silently upserts, and selects a new collection name distinct from the stale one\n- [ ] `embed.py`'s interleaved (D4) output list index `i` corresponds to `pages[i]` for the 3-window synthetic fixture\n- [ ] a page's sparse lexical/caption surface contains that page's known caption tokens (fixture-known substring match)\n\n---\n\nUnit ID: U011\nTest Levels: [L0, L1, L2, conformance]\nSuites / Commands: `bash scripts/test-unit.sh -k \"gates or export_pure\"` ; `bash scripts/test-api.sh -k \"publish_atomic or grounded_rate_gate or scanned_skip or lease or sigterm_publish or runs_show or gates_rerun\"`\nTest Coverage:\n- Happy Path: `test_window_coverage_blocks_below_1_0`, `test_offset_check_blocks_failing_window`, `test_publish_override_flags_pages`, `test_runs_show_prints_run_record`, `test_gates_rerun_no_new_vlm_calls`\n- Edge Cases: `test_scanned_doc_skips_grounded_rate_gate_publishes_not_searchable`, `test_label_monotonic_flags_without_blocking`, `test_three_clause_retirement_isolated_evaluation`\n- Error Cases (typed 4xx per §7.3): N/A — gates/publish are ingest-side operations, not the query API's caller-facing bound\n- Degradation (§11.3): `test_sigterm_mid_publish_checkpoints_resumable`, `test_lease_prevents_double_run_same_doc_id`\nTest Data: Fixtures `data/fixtures/synthetic_3window/` (U007) plus derived outputs from U009/U010 | Stubs ephemeral Qdrant (`vsir_runs` control collection)\nNotes: **Superseded guide warnings** — `impl/pipeline-guide/10-gates-and-publish.md` (step 11) documents deleted `allowlist`/`class_totality` gates; only `window_coverage`, `offset_check`, `grounded_rate`, `text_coverage`,